abstract: >-
  A trustless cross-chain atomic swap protocol between Monero (XMR) and
  Starknet assets. The system uses on-chain Discrete Logarithm Equality
  (DLEQ) proof verification via Garaga's multi-scalar multiplication (MSM)
  on the Ed25519 curve, a two-phase unlock mechanism to mitigate race
  conditions, and an optimistic fraud proof system (MoneroVM) for verifying
  RandomX proof-of-work computations on Starknet. The protocol enables
  trustless Monero interoperability without requiring changes to the
  Monero protocol itself.
